OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FFifa has responded to widespread
OL,7,Fcriticism over its plan to sell stakes
OL,8,Fin its competitions to private
OL,9,Finvestors by insisting it will press
OL,10,Fahead with the consultation process.
OL,12,FFootball's global governing body
OL,13,Finsisted that "nobody is selling
OL,14,Ffootball" in a statement released on
OL,15,FFriday morning, saying they have
OL,16,F"heard the feedback provided by the
OL,17,Frespective confederations" in relation
OL,18,Fto the plans.
OL,26,@uD@OOUvD@IO]
