OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FUefa reacted furiously when the plans
OL,7,Fto create Fifa Forward Enterprise
OL,8,F(FFE) first emerged in media reports
OL,9,Fin The Times and the Financial Times
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, Uefa's 55 member
OL,13,Fassociations said they would boycott
OL,14,Fthe World Cup if the plan goes ahead
OL,15,Fas proposed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FFollowing a virtual meeting of
OL,7,FEuropean football's governing body on
OL,8,FThursday, all members voted
OL,9,Funanimously to boycott all men's and
OL,10,Fwomen's tournaments organised by Fifa
OL,11,Fif the controversial investment plan
OL,12,Fis approved.
OL,14,FA statement issued on behalf of all
OL,15,FUefa members said all 55 of its member
OL,16,Fassociations, which include the
OL,17,FEnglish Football Association, "stand
OL,18,Fas one" as they "unequivocally reject
OL,19,FFifa's proposal".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,F"The World Cup cannot be treated as an
OL,7,Finvestment product. It is one of
OL,8,Ffootball's greatest sporting
OL,9,Flegacies," Uefa added.
OL,11,F"It has been built over generations by
OL,12,Fplayers, national teams and supporters
OL,13,Facross every continent. No part of it
OL,14,Fshould ever be surrendered to private
OL,15,Finvestors. The World Cup is not for
OL,16,Fsale."
OL,18,FHow has Fifa responded?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FIn their statement following the
OL,7,Fbacklash, Fifa said they wanted to
OL,8,Faddress the issues that have arisen
OL,9,Fsince the initial media reporting on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,F"We respect the feedback and concern
OL,13,Faired in public and reaffirm our
OL,14,Fcommitment to an open and democratic
OL,15,Fconsultation.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
