CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,F"Our planned consultation process was
OL,7,Fdisrupted by incorrect media reports.
OL,8,FWe will proceed with this consultation
OL,9,Fprocess to ensure that each MA has the
OL,10,Fability to express its vote based on
OL,11,Ffacts."
OL,26,@nD@BO]sD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
