CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe statement continued: "FFE has been
OL,7,Fproposed solely to ensure that all
OL,8,FFIFA Member Associations (MAs) have
OL,9,Fthe opportunity to take meaningful
OL,10,Fownership of the commercial
OL,11,Fopportunity of football in their
OL,12,Frespective countries, and that this
OL,13,Fdoes not come at the cost of either
OL,14,Fthe spirit or the governance of FIFA
OL,15,For football itself.
OL,17,F"Nobody is selling football. This is
OL,18,Fnot something FIFA would ever
OL,19,Fentertain."
OL,26,@nD@ZOUyD@AOU{D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/17
