OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe statement added that "each MA
OL,7,F(Member Association) should be allowed
OL,8,Fto review the proposal and have a say
OL,9,Fin shaping their own future".
OL,11,FWhat are Fifa's plans?
OL,13,FFifa is proposing to sell stakes in
OL,14,Fits major competitions - including the
OL,15,FWorld Cup - to private backers under a
OL,16,Fscheme led by the brother of Donald
OL,17,FTrump's son-in-law.
OL,26,@nD@ZOUqD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/17
