OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FIt wants to set up a new private
OL,7,Fcompany, called Fifa Forward
OL,8,FEnterprise (FFE), which would take
OL,9,Fcontrol of all commercial and event
OL,10,Foperations, including the World Cup.
OL,12,FFFE would be owned and controlled by
OL,13,FFifa, the global body said, but the
OL,14,Fintention is to sell minority stakes
OL,15,Fto private investors. Uefa and other
OL,16,Fbodies have raised concerns the deal
OL,17,Fwill mean "selling the soul of
OL,18,Ffootball".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
