PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe lead investor is proposed to be
OL,7,FThrive Eternal, a company founded by
OL,8,FJoshua Kushner, the brother of
OL,9,FPresident Trump's son-in-law, Jared
OL,10,FKushner.
OL,12,FMeanwhile, bankers at JP Morgan would
OL,13,Fbe working with Fifa to bring in
OL,14,Fexternal investors.
OL,16,FFifa estimates that setting up FFE
OL,17,Fwould raise up to $4.2 billion (#3.2
OL,18,Fbillion) from private investors and
OL,19,Fsays that money would be offered to
OL,20,Fall 211 of Fifa's member associations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
