OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThey would be able to access a one-off
OL,7,Flump sum of $20 million (#15 million)
OL,8,Fto help develop football in their
OL,9,Frespective countries.
OL,11,FIt says the plan would enable Fifa to
OL,12,Fmake significant increases to
OL,13,Fdevelopment funding available ` up to
OL,14,F$10 billion (#7.5 billion) ` in the
OL,15,Fthree-year cycle between 2027 and 2030.
