OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, Fifa President Gianni
OL,7,FInfantino issued an ultimatum to
OL,8,Fmembers, with a deadline of September
OL,9,F19 to make a decision.
OL,11,FHe warned that the $10 billion
OL,12,Fdevelopment funding pot, which he said
OL,13,Fwould give members access to up to $40
OL,14,Fmillion each from January 2027, would
OL,15,Fbe stripped down by 75% to $2.7billion
OL,16,F(around #2 billion) if Fifa's plans
OL,17,Fare rejected by members.
OL,19,FWhat have others said?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
