OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FOn Thursday, Concacaf (the
OL,7,FConfederation of North, Central
OL,8,FAmerica and Caribbean Association
OL,9,FFootball) stopped short of a boycott,
OL,10,Fbut said its 41 member associations
OL,11,Fhad "rejected" Fifa's proposal.
OL,13,FCarlsberg, the official sponsor of
OL,14,FUefa national team football, already
OL,15,Fchimed in with a critique of the
OL,16,F"hydration breaks", viewed by many as
OL,17,Fa way to sell additional advertising
OL,18,Fslots, introduced in this summer's
OL,19,FWorld Cup.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
