OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FA post on the beer brand's Instagram
OL,7,Faccount said: "Time for a hydration
OL,8,Fbreak, Gianni? Probably."
OL,10,FAn English FA spokesperson said: "We
OL,11,Fstand shoulder to shoulder with our
OL,12,FEuropean colleagues and fully support
OL,13,Fthe collective view. We oppose FIFA's
OL,14,Fplans - the FIFA World Cup belongs to
OL,15,Ffootball and always will."
OL,26,@rD@bOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/17
