OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe Scottish FA said that it "agrees
OL,7,Funequivocally with the concerns raised
OL,8,Fby all members over the manner in
OL,9,Fwhich these proposals have been
OL,10,Fissued, and deadline set, without a
OL,11,Ffull consultation process or
OL,12,Fconsideration to good governance".
OL,14,FJesper Moller, chairman of the Danish
OL,15,FFootball Association, argued that
OL,16,FFifa's proposal is "selling the soul
OL,17,Fof football", adding, "We will
OL,18,Ftherefore support every measure
OL,19,Fnecessary to stop this project".
OL,26,@vD@Io|
