OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe project is the second time
OL,7,FInfantino has tried to push through a
OL,8,Fmulti-billion dollar deal with private
OL,9,Fbackers.
OL,11,FIn 2018, the Fifa president proposed a
OL,12,Fsecretive $25bn (#18.8bn) offer over
OL,13,F12 years with SoftBank of Japan to
OL,14,Fcreate new global competitions,
OL,15,Fincluding an expanded men's Club World
OL,16,FCup, seemingly backed by Saudi Arabian
OL,17,Fmoney.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/17
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
