OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785516478
OL,3,CFifa presses ahead with investment
OL,4,Cplan despite UEFA boycott threats
OL,6,FThe plan ultimately failed after
OL,7,Fmeeting fierce resistance from Uefa,
OL,8,Fas it threatened the Champions League
OL,9,Fand the European Championship.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/17
